    "html": "<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html lang=\"en-AU\">\n<head>\n    <meta charset=\"UTF-8\">\n    <meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0\">\n    <title>NRP-023: Association Memberships & Benefits - Complete Training Module</title>\n    <style>\n        * { margin: 0; padding: 0; box-sizing: border-box; }\n        body {\n            font-family: 'Segoe UI', Tahoma, Geneva, Verdana, sans-serif;\n            line-height: 1.6;\n            color: #333;\n            background: linear-gradient(135deg, #8b5cf6 0%, #6d28d9 100%);\n            min-height: 100vh;\n        }\n        .container {\n            max-width: 1200px;\n            margin: 0 auto;\n            padding: 20px;\n            background: white;\n            margin-top: 20px;\n            margin-bottom: 20px;\n            border-radius: 15px;\n            box-shadow: 0 20px 40px rgba(0,0,0,0.1);\n        }\n        .header {\n            background: linear-gradient(135deg, #8b5cf6 0%, #6d28d9 100%);\n            color: white;\n            padding: 30px;\n            text-align: center;\n            border-radius: 15px 15px 0 0;\n            margin: -20px -20px 30px -20px;\n        }\n        .header h1 { font-size: 2.5em; margin-bottom: 10px; }\n        .header p { font-size: 1.2em; opacity: 0.9; }\n        .section {\n            margin: 30px 0;\n            padding: 25px;\n            background: #f8f9fa;\n            border-radius: 10px;\n            border-left: 5px solid #8b5cf6;\n        }\n        .section h2 {\n            color: #6d28d9;\n            margin-bottom: 20px;\n            font-size: 1.8em;\n        }\n        .membership-tier {\n            background: white;\n            border: 2px solid #e9d5ff;\n            border-radius: 12px;\n            padding: 25px;\n            margin: 20px 0;\n            position: relative;\n            overflow: hidden;\n        }\n        .membership-tier::before {\n            content: '';\n            position: absolute;\n            top: 0;\n            left: 0;\n            width: 5px;\n            height: 100%;\n        }\n        .tier-bronze::before { background: #cd7f32; }\n        .tier-silver::before { background: #c0c0c0; }\n        .tier-gold::before { background: #ffd700; }\n        .tier-platinum::before { background: linear-gradient(135deg, #e5e4e2, #b9f2ff); }\n        .tier-header {\n            display: flex;\n            justify-content: space-between;\n            align-items: center;\n            margin-bottom: 15px;\n        }\n        .tier-name {\n            font-size: 1.4em;\n            font-weight: bold;\n            color: #6d28d9;\n        }\n        .tier-badge {\n            padding: 5px 15px;\n            border-radius: 20px;\n            font-size: 0.9em;\n            font-weight: bold;\n            color: white;\n        }\n        .badge-candidate { background: #cd7f32; }\n        .badge-partner { background: #c0c0c0; }\n        .badge-preferred { background: #ffd700; color: #333; }\n        .badge-premium { background: linear-gradient(135deg, #8b5cf6, #6d28d9); }\n        .benefit-list {\n            margin: 15px 0;\n        }\n        .benefit-item {\n            display: flex;\n            align-items: flex-start;\n            margin: 10px 0;\n            padding: 10px;\n            background: #faf5ff;\n            border-radius: 6px;\n        }\n        .benefit-icon {\n            color: #8b5cf6;\n            margin-right: 10px;\n            font-size: 1.2em;\n        }\n        .stats-grid {\n            display: grid;\n            grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(200px, 1fr));\n            gap: 20px;\n            margin: 20px 0;\n        }\n        .stat-card {\n            background: linear-gradient(135deg, #8b5cf6 0%, #6d28d9 100%);\n            color: white;\n            padding: 20px;\n            border-radius: 10px;\n            text-align: center;\n        }\n        .stat-number { font-size: 2em; font-weight: bold; margin-bottom: 5px; }\n        .stat-label { opacity: 0.9; }\n        .comparison-table {\n            width: 100%;\n            border-collapse: collapse;\n            margin: 20px 0;\n            background: white;\n            border-radius: 8px;\n            overflow: hidden;\n        }\n        .comparison-table th {\n            background: #8b5cf6;\n            color: white;\n            padding: 15px;\n            text-align: left;\n            font-weight: 600;\n        }\n        .comparison-table td {\n            padding: 12px 15px;\n            border-bottom: 1px solid #e9d5ff;\n        }\n        .comparison-table tr:hover {\n            background: #faf5ff;\n        }\n        .checkmark { color: #10b981; font-weight: bold; }\n        .crossmark { color: #ef4444; font-weight: bold; }\n        .alert-box {\n            background: #dbeafe;\n            border-left: 4px solid #3b82f6;\n            padding: 15px;\n            border-radius: 8px;\n            margin: 20px 0;\n        }\n        .highlight-box {\n            background: #fef3c7;\n            border-left: 4px solid #f59e0b;\n            padding: 15px;\n            border-radius: 8px;\n            margin: 20px 0;\n        }\n        @media (max-width: 768px) {\n            .container { margin: 10px; padding: 15px; }\n            .stats-grid { grid-template-columns: 1fr; }\n        }\n    </style>\n</head>\n<body>\n    <div class=\"container\">\n        <div class=\"header\">\n            <h1>🏅 NRP-023: Association Memberships & Benefits</h1>\n            <p>Complete Guide to IICRC Australia, NRPG Partnership Levels & Industry Associations</p>\n            <p><strong>Duration:</strong> 35 minutes | <strong>Assessment:</strong> 10 questions | <strong>Category:</strong> Professional Development</p>\n        </div>\n\n        <div class=\"section\">\n            <h2>📋 Module Overview</h2>\n            <p>This comprehensive module covers professional association memberships available to Australian restoration contractors, focusing on IICRC Australia certification, NRPG partnership levels, insurance benefits, marketing support, and industry association opportunities. Learn how membership investments return value through discounts, leads, and professional credibility.</p>\n\n            <div class=\"stats-grid\">\n                <div class=\"stat-card\">\n                    <div class=\"stat-number\">4</div>\n                    <div class=\"stat-label\">Partnership Tiers</div>\n                </div>\n                <div class=\"stat-card\">\n                    <div class=\"stat-number\">15-25%</div>\n                    <div class=\"stat-label\">Insurance Savings</div>\n                </div>\n                <div class=\"stat-card\">\n                    <div class=\"stat-number\">$18K</div>\n                    <div class=\"stat-label\">Avg Annual Benefits Value</div>\n                </div>\n                <div class=\"stat-card\">\n                    <div class=\"stat-number\">2,847</div>\n                    <div class=\"stat-label\">NRPG Members Australia</div>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n        </div>\n\n        <div class=\"section\">\n            <h2>🎯 Learning Objectives</h2>\n            <ul style=\"margin-left: 20px; line-height: 2;\">\n                <li><strong>Understand IICRC Australia membership</strong> requirements and benefits</li>\n                <li><strong>Navigate NRPG partnership tiers</strong> from Candidate to Premium level</li>\n                <li><strong>Calculate insurance premium savings</strong> from professional memberships</li>\n                <li><strong>Access marketing and lead generation benefits</strong> through associations</li>\n                <li><strong>Leverage industry association networks</strong> for business growth</li>\n            </ul>\n        </div>\n\n        <div class=\"section\">\n            <h2>🏛️ IICRC Australia Membership</h2>\n\n            <p>The Institute of Inspection, Cleaning and Restoration Certification (IICRC Australia) is the primary professional certification body for restoration contractors in Australia.</p>\n\n            <div class=\"alert-box\">\n                <h4 style=\"color: #1d4ed8; margin-bottom: 10px;\">📖 IICRC Australia Official Information</h4>\n                <p><strong>Website:</strong> https://iicrc.org.au/<br>\n                <strong>Founded:</strong> 2003 (Australian chapter established)<br>\n                <strong>Members:</strong> 6,200+ certified professionals across Australia<br>\n                <strong>Recognition:</strong> Industry standard for insurance, commercial, and government work</p>\n            </div>\n\n            <h3 style=\"color: #6d28d9; margin-top: 25px;\">IICRC Certification Categories</h3>\n\n            <table class=\"comparison-table\">\n                <thead>\n                    <tr>\n                        <th>Certification</th>\n                        <th>Initial Cost</th>\n                        <th>Annual Renewal</th>\n                        <th>CEC Required</th>\n                        <th>Industry Demand</th>\n                    </tr>\n                </thead>\n                <tbody>\n                    <tr>\n                        <td><strong>WRT</strong> - Water Restoration Technician</td>\n                        <td>$495 + GST</td>\n                        <td>$165 + GST</td>\n                        <td>10 CEC</td>\n                        <td>⭐⭐⭐⭐⭐ Essential</td>\n                    </tr>\n                    <tr>\n                        <td><strong>ASD</strong> - Applied Structural Drying</td>\n                        <td>$595 + GST</td>\n                        <td>$165 + GST</td>\n                        <td>10 CEC</td>\n                        <td>⭐⭐⭐⭐⭐ Essential</td>\n                    </tr>\n                    <tr>\n                        <td><strong>AMRT</strong> - Applied Microbial Remediation</td>\n                        <td>$595 + GST</td>\n                        <td>$165 + GST</td>\n                        <td>10 CEC</td>\n                        <td>⭐⭐⭐⭐ High demand</td>\n                    </tr>\n                    <tr>\n                        <td><strong>FSRT</strong> - Fire & Smoke Restoration</td>\n                        <td>$495 + GST</td>\n                        <td>$165 + GST</td>\n                        <td>10 CEC</td>\n                        <td>⭐⭐⭐⭐ High demand</td>\n                    </tr>\n                    <tr>\n                        <td><strong>CCT</strong> - Carpet Cleaning Technician</td>\n                        <td>$395 + GST</td>\n                        <td>$165 + GST</td>\n                        <td>10 CEC</td>\n                        <td>⭐⭐⭐ Moderate</td>\n                    </tr>\n                    <tr>\n                        <td><strong>Master Water Restorer</strong></td>\n                        <td>$1,295 + GST</td>\n                        <td>$275 + GST</td>\n                        <td>15 CEC</td>\n                        <td>⭐⭐⭐⭐⭐ Premium jobs</td>\n                    </tr>\n                </tbody>\n            </table>\n\n            <h3 style=\"color: #6d28d9; margin-top: 25px;\">Benefits of IICRC Certification</h3>\n\n            <div class=\"benefit-list\">\n                <div class=\"benefit-item\">\n                    <span class=\"benefit-icon\">✅</span>\n                    <div>\n                        <strong>Insurance Company Requirements:</strong> Most major Australian insurers (IAG, Suncorp, Allianz, QBE) require IICRC WRT minimum for preferred contractor panels.\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n                <div class=\"benefit-item\">\n                    <span class=\"benefit-icon\">✅</span>\n                    <div>\n                        <strong>Premium Job Access:</strong> Commercial and government tenders typically mandate IICRC certification. Average job value 40% higher for certified contractors.\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n                <div class=\"benefit-item\">\n                    <span class=\"benefit-icon\">✅</span>\n                    <div>\n                        <strong>Professional Credibility:</strong> Recognised qualification demonstrates commitment to industry standards and ongoing education.\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n                <div class=\"benefit-item\">\n                    <span class=\"benefit-icon\">✅</span>\n                    <div>\n                        <strong>DR-NRPG Merit Score Bonus:</strong> +10 points added to merit score for each IICRC certification held (max +30 points).\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n                <div class=\"benefit-item\">\n                    <span class=\"benefit-icon\">✅</span>\n                    <div>\n                        <strong>Networking Opportunities:</strong> Access to IICRC Australia conferences, regional meetings, and member-only forums.\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n        </div>\n\n        <div class=\"section\">\n            <h2>🚀 NRPG Partnership Levels</h2>\n\n            <p>The DR-NRPG platform operates a tiered partnership system based on performance, tenure, and professional development. Higher tiers unlock better job allocation, reduced fees, and premium support.</p>\n\n            <div class=\"membership-tier tier-bronze\">\n                <div class=\"tier-header\">\n                    <div class=\"tier-name\">CANDIDATE Level</div>\n                    <div class=\"tier-badge badge-candidate\">Entry Level</div>\n                </div>\n                <p><strong>Requirements:</strong> New contractors (0-6 months) | Merit score 40-54 | Minimum WRT certification</p>\n\n                <h4 style=\"color: #6d28d9; margin-top: 15px;\">Benefits Included:</h4>\n                <ul style=\"margin-left: 20px; line-height: 2;\">\n                    <li>Standard job rotation access</li>\n                    <li>Platform fee: 12% + GST</li>\n                    <li>24/7 support access</li>\n                    <li>Basic training modules (20 NRPG courses)</li>\n                    <li>Monthly payment processing</li>\n                    <li>Profile listing in contractor directory</li>\n                </ul>\n            </div>\n\n            <div class=\"membership-tier tier-silver\">\n                <div class=\"tier-header\">\n                    <div class=\"tier-name\">PARTNER Level</div>\n                    <div class=\"tier-badge badge-partner\">Standard</div>\n                </div>\n                <p><strong>Requirements:</strong> 6+ months tenure | Merit score 55-69 | WRT + 1 additional cert | 50+ completed jobs</p>\n\n                <h4 style=\"color: #6d28d9; margin-top: 15px;\">Additional Benefits:</h4>\n                <ul style=\"margin-left: 20px; line-height: 2;\">\n                    <li><strong>Platform fee reduced to 11% + GST</strong> (save $1,000+ annually)</li>\n                    <li>Priority rotation for emergency jobs</li>\n                    <li>Featured listing in contractor directory</li>\n                    <li>Quarterly performance reviews with bonus job allocations</li>\n                    <li>Access to exclusive PARTNER webinars</li>\n                    <li>Marketing materials (digital badges, certificates)</li>\n                </ul>\n            </div>\n\n            <div class=\"membership-tier tier-gold\">\n                <div class=\"tier-header\">\n                    <div class=\"tier-name\">PREFERRED Level</div>\n                    <div class=\"tier-badge badge-preferred\">Premium</div>\n                </div>\n                <p><strong>Requirements:</strong> 12+ months tenure | Merit score 70-84 | WRT + ASD + 1 more | 150+ jobs | 4.5+ star rating</p>\n\n                <h4 style=\"color: #6d28d9; margin-top: 15px;\">Premium Benefits:</h4>\n                <ul style=\"margin-left: 20px; line-height: 2;\">\n                    <li><strong>Platform fee reduced to 10% + GST</strong> (save $2,000+ annually)</li>\n                    <li><strong>Insurance discount program:</strong> 15% off public liability and professional indemnity</li>\n                    <li>First-tier job allocation (offered jobs before PARTNER level)</li>\n                    <li>Dedicated account manager</li>\n                    <li>Featured homepage placement (rotational)</li>\n                    <li>Annual conference ticket included ($795 value)</li>\n                    <li>Premium marketing package (website badge, social media graphics, print materials)</li>\n                    <li>Bi-weekly payment processing (improved cash flow)</li>\n                </ul>\n            </div>\n\n            <div class=\"membership-tier tier-platinum\">\n                <div class=\"tier-header\">\n                    <div class=\"tier-name\">PREMIUM Level</div>\n                    <div class=\"tier-badge badge-premium\">Elite</div>\n                </div>\n                <p><strong>Requirements:</strong> 24+ months tenure | Merit score 85+ | Master cert OR 4+ IICRC certs | 300+ jobs | 4.8+ rating</p>\n\n                <h4 style=\"color: #6d28d9; margin-top: 15px;\">Elite Benefits:</h4>\n                <ul style=\"margin-left: 20px; line-height: 2;\">\n                    <li><strong>Platform fee reduced to 8% + GST</strong> (save $4,000+ annually on $100K revenue)</li>\n                    <li><strong>Insurance discount program:</strong> 25% off all insurance policies</li>\n                    <li><strong>Exclusive job access:</strong> High-value commercial jobs ($20K+) offered to PREMIUM first</li>\n                    <li>Personal concierge support (priority line, dedicated contact)</li>\n                    <li>Permanent homepage hero placement</li>\n                    <li>Two conference tickets included annually ($1,590 value)</li>\n                    <li>Comprehensive marketing suite (video testimonials, case studies, PR support)</li>\n                    <li>Weekly payment processing</li>\n                    <li>Early access to new platform features (beta testing)</li>\n                    <li>Invitation to exclusive PREMIUM roundtable events</li>\n                </ul>\n            </div>\n        </div>\n\n        <div class=\"section\">\n            <h2>💰 Financial Benefits Breakdown</h2>\n\n            <p>Professional memberships and higher partnership tiers deliver substantial financial returns through reduced fees and insurance discounts.</p>\n\n            <div class=\"highlight-box\">\n                <h4 style=\"color: #d97706; margin-bottom: 10px;\">💡 Example: Annual Savings Calculation</h4>\n                <p><strong>Scenario:</strong> Contractor with $100,000 annual revenue through DR-NRPG platform</p>\n\n                <table style=\"width: 100%; margin-top: 15px; border-collapse: collapse;\">\n                    <thead>\n                        <tr style=\"background: #fef3c7;\">\n                            <th style=\"padding: 10px; text-align: left;\">Partnership Level</th>\n                            <th style=\"padding: 10px; text-align: right;\">Platform Fee</th>\n                            <th style=\"padding: 10px; text-align: right;\">Insurance Savings</th>\n                            <th style=\"padding: 10px; text-align: right;\">Total Annual Savings</th>\n                        </tr>\n                    </thead>\n                    <tbody>\n                        <tr>\n                            <td style=\"padding: 10px;\">CANDIDATE (12%)</td>\n                            <td style=\"padding: 10px; text-align: right;\">$12,000</td>\n                            <td style=\"padding: 10px; text-align: right;\">$0</td>\n                            <td style=\"padding: 10px; text-align: right; font-weight: bold;\">Baseline</td>\n                        </tr>\n                        <tr>\n                            <td style=\"padding: 10px;\">PARTNER (11%)</td>\n                            <td style=\"padding: 10px; text-align: right;\">$11,000</td>\n                            <td style=\"padding: 10px; text-align: right;\">$0</td>\n                            <td style=\"padding: 10px; text-align: right; font-weight: bold; color: #10b981;\">+$1,000</td>\n                        </tr>\n                        <tr>\n                            <td style=\"padding: 10px;\">PREFERRED (10%)</td>\n                            <td style=\"padding: 10px; text-align: right;\">$10,000</td>\n                            <td style=\"padding: 10px; text-align: right;\">$900 (15% off $6K insurance)</td>\n                            <td style=\"padding: 10px; text-align: right; font-weight: bold; color: #10b981;\">+$2,900</td>\n                        </tr>\n                        <tr>\n                            <td style=\"padding: 10px;\">PREMIUM (8%)</td>\n                            <td style=\"padding: 10px; text-align: right;\">$8,000</td>\n                            <td style=\"padding: 10px; text-align: right;\">$1,500 (25% off $6K insurance)</td>\n                            <td style=\"padding: 10px; text-align: right; font-weight: bold; color: #10b981;\">+$5,500</td>\n                        </tr>\n                    </tbody>\n                </table>\n\n                <p style=\"margin-top: 15px;\"><strong>Key Insight:</strong> Reaching PREMIUM level on $100K revenue saves $5,500 annually compared to CANDIDATE level. ROI increases significantly at higher revenue levels.</p>\n            </div>\n\n            <h3 style=\"color: #6d28d9; margin-top: 25px;\">Insurance Partnership Discounts</h3>\n\n            <p>DR-NRPG has negotiated exclusive group rates with major Australian insurance providers for PREFERRED and PREMIUM members:</p>\n\n            <table class=\"comparison-table\">\n                <thead>\n                    <tr>\n                        <th>Insurance Type</th>\n                        <th>Standard Annual Premium</th>\n                        <th>PREFERRED Discount (15%)</th>\n                        <th>PREMIUM Discount (25%)</th>\n                    </tr>\n                </thead>\n                <tbody>\n                    <tr>\n                        <td>Public Liability ($20M cover)</td>\n                        <td>$3,200</td>\n                        <td>$2,720 <span style=\"color: #10b981;\">(save $480)</span></td>\n                        <td>$2,400 <span style=\"color: #10b981;\">(save $800)</span></td>\n                    </tr>\n                    <tr>\n                        <td>Professional Indemnity ($5M)</td>\n                        <td>$2,100</td>\n                        <td>$1,785 <span style=\"color: #10b981;\">(save $315)</span></td>\n                        <td>$1,575 <span style=\"color: #10b981;\">(save $525)</span></td>\n                    </tr>\n                    <tr>\n                        <td>Tools & Equipment Insurance</td>\n                        <td>$850</td>\n                        <td>$722 <span style=\"color: #10b981;\">(save $128)</span></td>\n                        <td>$637 <span style=\"color: #10b981;\">(save $213)</span></td>\n                    </tr>\n                    <tr>\n                        <td><strong>Total Annual Savings</strong></td>\n                        <td><strong>$6,150</strong></td>\n                        <td><strong>$923/year</strong></td>\n                        <td><strong>$1,538/year</strong></td>\n                    </tr>\n                </tbody>\n            </table>\n\n            <p style=\"margin-top: 15px;\"><strong>Insurance Partners:</strong> Allianz, QBE, Zurich | Coverage meets all major insurer requirements | Discounts applied automatically upon tier qualification</p>\n        </div>\n\n        <div class=\"section\">\n            <h2>📣 Marketing & Lead Generation Benefits</h2>\n\n            <p>Higher partnership tiers include comprehensive marketing support to help contractors attract direct clients outside the DR-NRPG platform.</p>\n\n            <h3 style=\"color: #6d28d9;\">Marketing Assets by Tier</h3>\n\n            <table class=\"comparison-table\">\n                <thead>\n                    <tr>\n                        <th>Marketing Asset</th>\n                        <th>CANDIDATE</th>\n                        <th>PARTNER</th>\n                        <th>PREFERRED</th>\n                        <th>PREMIUM</th>\n                    </tr>\n                </thead>\n                <tbody>\n                    <tr>\n                        <td>Digital Badge (website embeddable)</td>\n                        <td><span class=\"checkmark\">✓</span></td>\n                        <td><span class=\"checkmark\">✓</span></td>\n                        <td><span class=\"checkmark\">✓</span></td>\n                        <td><span class=\"checkmark\">✓</span></td>\n                    </tr>\n                    <tr>\n                        <td>Certification Certificates (PDF)</td>\n                        <td><span class=\"checkmark\">✓</span></td>\n                        <td><span class=\"checkmark\">✓</span></td>\n                        <td><span class=\"checkmark\">✓</span></td>\n                        <td><span class=\"checkmark\">✓</span></td>\n                    </tr>\n                    <tr>\n                        <td>Social Media Graphics Pack</td>\n                        <td><span class=\"crossmark\">✗</span></td>\n                        <td><span class=\"checkmark\">✓</span></td>\n                        <td><span class=\"checkmark\">✓</span></td>\n                        <td><span class=\"checkmark\">✓</span></td>\n                    </tr>\n                    <tr>\n                        <td>Contractor Directory Featured Listing</td>\n                        <td><span class=\"crossmark\">✗</span></td>\n          